{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["And the reason for <b>ושכת על הארן</b> (\"and you shall screen upon the Ark\") in place of \"אל\" is that ושכת is from the stem of מסך (screen). And likewise: וישם את פרכת המסך ויסך על ארן העדת — \"and he set up the curtain of the screen and screened upon the Ark of the Testimony\" (Exodus 40:21)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:22:30.789369958Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}